  "description": "The celestial worlds were once a radiant dreamscape, powered by the celestial Ray of Light. But something has gone wrong — the light has splintered, and the land is fading. Magical creatures are losing their glow, and the skies have dimmed to twilight.\n\nYou play as Lotzo, a small purple guardian with glowing turquoise markings, fluttering red wings, and boundless energy. Alongside your floating companion — a cheerful spirit, you’ll journey through mystical lands to recover the scattered light and rekindle the world’s brilliance.\n\nFluid, Joyful Movement\n- Glide, dash, and double-jump through painterly landscapes\n- Responsive controls and smooth animations with tons of charm\n\nMagical Companions & Powers\n- Your spirit friend helps reveal secrets and guide you through the worlds\n- Collect light fragments to unlock new abilities: air roll, back flip and more.\n\nPainterly Visuals & Emotional Resonance\n- Stylized lighting, glowing effects, and soft textures create a magical, storybook feel\n- Character designs are expressive and endearing, with mythic charm and playful energy",
